T Triangulated square
# The one rule that makes everything close: the diagonal of an n x n square is the next rod up the ladder.
# 2U sides are blue, so the diagonal is a yellow (2 root 2). A rectangle has no legal diagonal at all.
! square
C A W8 0,0,0
C B W8 2,0,0
C C W8 2,2,0
C D W8 0,2,0
R A B
R B C
R C D
R D A
! the brace that stops it racking
R A C
